msgctxt "92"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Get me outta here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "If you don't mind my asking... What the hell are you doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Well, see... Somebody was tryin' to attack us, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"And I was totally freaked out... Well, kind of, anyway. A little bit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "So I hid in here to be safe. Clever, don'cha think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "And you managed to get yourself stuck..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Well, it'd take forever to explain the whole story... But, yeah. In a "
"nutshell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Hey! What are you doing in there!?"
msgstr "Oi! Che ci fai quassù!?"

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Crap! They found me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Oh, boy... Okay, let me just open the⑬ Uh-oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "224"
msgid "The key... Where's the key?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Hey...! Don't tell me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "No way! You gotta be freakin' kiddin' me! You mean I'm stuck in here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Kiryu-san... My mom and little sister live in the countryside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "They grow carrots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "They're really good, those carrots. Even when you eat 'em raw."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"The way I've been livin'... Well, I haven't seen my family for years..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Could you tell 'em..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Oh, here it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Could you tell my mom and my sis I'm okay⑬ Wait, what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "I found the key. I'm unlocking it now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "What the hell... Don't scare a guy like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Seriously! I mean, give a guy a break, would ya? Haha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"I mean c'mon! You're supposed to be manager material, right? Shouldn't you "
"at least be able to find a damn key right away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Obviously, you got a lot to work on. Do you want me to give you some "
"pointers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Should we leave him in there a little longer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Yeah, that sounds like a good idea."
msgstr "Oh? Sembra una buona idea."

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Hey, wait a minute! That ain't funny!"
msgstr ""

